5,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I am less interested in the renderings than in the durability of our previous projects.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,The ground conditions here are unpredictable. We need to verify what the soil actually allows.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Mio,,I am worried about the long-term maintenance costs. The initial budget is rarely the final cost.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Asuka,,Who is actually going to maintain this? The staffing levels have dropped significantly.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minako,,"We must consider how the public actually uses the space, not just how it looks.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,Agreed. The civic hall apron has been patched three times already.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, that is a good point. I want to check the tendering firms.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, the groundskeeping roll is a major concern for me too.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I will look into the volunteer groups to see if they can fill the gap.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minako,,I need to understand the drainage issues and how people cross the site.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,Let us look at the condition of the earlier works to see what lasts.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will check the regional firms tendering for earth-moving to assess risk.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will examine the upkeep ledger to see the real cost per hectare.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will review the groundskeeping roll and the bought-in services.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minako,,I will look at the drainage callouts and the timed counts of crossings.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
