35,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The eastern avenue planting failed because aftercare was excluded. We must avoid that trap.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"Only two firms tender for earth-moving, and both flag clay subsoil risk. This is concerning.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Mio,,The upkeep ledger shows planted ground costs triple that of hard surfaces. That is a huge gap.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The groundskeeping roll is down to seven. We rely heavily on bought-in services now.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Minako,,"Drainage callouts have doubled. People stick to firm ground, avoiding the softer margins.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Mio, that triple cost is alarming. It confirms my fear about long-term viability.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, the clay risk means any heavy earth-moving is high-risk and potentially slow.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Asuka, if the roll is that small, we cannot afford a high-maintenance landscape.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Minako, if people avoid the margins, a wetland or dense woodland might be underused.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Misaki, the phasing notes say the centre cannot be hoarded. That limits our options.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The habitat fund only pays for planting and water, not surfacing. That restricts us.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Benjamin, that is a critical constraint. We cannot build structures with that money.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Mio,,So we are looking at low-maintenance options. Hard surfaces are cheaper to keep.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Asuka,,"The volunteer groups are active, but they are specific to habitat or sports.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Minako,,We need a plan that fits the existing usage patterns and the budget reality.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
51,2,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
52,2,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
