60,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Given the fund terms, Market Plaza is out. It needs surfacing and structures.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Wetland Restoration is risky with the clay subsoil and high drainage callouts.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Mio,,Woodland Walk has high upkeep costs. The ledger shows it is triple the cost of hard surfaces.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Sports Terraces align with the volunteer groups and the firm ground preference.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Minako,,"The timed counts show people want firm, open ground. Sports Terraces fits that.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Asuka, the courts and running loop are durable. The earlier works show hard surfaces last.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Minako, the phasing notes say the southern ground can be hoarded. That works for terraces.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Benjamin, I agree. The maintenance cost for courts is manageable compared to turf.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Mio, the volunteer group already referees youth leagues. They can help with stewarding.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Misaki, the clay risk is lower for shallow work, which terraces require.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,I am leaning towards Sports Terraces. It is practical and durable.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. The earth-moving is minimal, reducing the risk from the clay subsoil.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Mio,,I support Sports Terraces. The upkeep cost is the lowest among the viable options.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I vote for Sports Terraces. It matches the staffing and volunteer capacity.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Minako,,I vote for Sports Terraces. It respects the user behavior and drainage constraints.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
